ligned}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1-3+4 \\\\ 5-6+1 \\\\ 2-12+10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. Since statement I is true, we have ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ for ${x}_{1}={x}_{3}=1$ and ${x}_{2}=-3.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since statement II is false, the set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345710 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345711 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345712 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345713 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345714 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1041 "selection" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1104 #edb/ref 17592186345712 13194139535358 true] [17592186345709 1110 #uuid "411021a7-c86a-5aa2-a647-2fa8f052a582" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345710 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345710 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535358 true] [17592186345710 1111 #uuid "aeb86d92-6893-5241-a76b-1b1701c15055" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345711 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345711 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535358 true] [17592186345711 1111 #uuid "2b93dc32-8d4f-5f56-822e-a9f960e256cb" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345712 1034 "I only" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345712 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535358 true] [17592186345712 1111 #uuid "eb582faf-85e7-5895-87c3-762111c9d3bc" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345713 1034 "III only" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345713 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535358 true] [17592186345713 1111 #uuid "f5acb448-247d-5657-860d-e3eefdfdf47e" 13194139535358 true] [17592186345714 1034 "